Package: ubuntu-start
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Daniel Nylander <daniel@nylander.se>
Homepage: https://github.com/yeager/ubuntu-start
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1
Description: Ubuntu Desktop first-run and device troubleshooting guide
 A GTK application with step-by-step Ubuntu guides, hardware and network
 troubleshooting, accessibility help and a Swedish translation.
